  "paragraphs": [
    "A 3D transition that folds the top layer in half onto itself (moving right, left, upward, or downward) while unfolding the second layer.",
    "Use the four Fold presets — one for each direction — for single-click setup of your origami-esque transitions. Simply keyframe the Mix duration (see below)&#160;and tune to taste! Find these presets via the blue Open Dashboard... button or the Choose a Preset... button below it.",
    "As with all other Universe tools, you can modify or create a Fold look and then save it under its own name by pressing the Save Preset... button."
  ],
